  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Reduce false positives with fixes found by scanning public .NET repositories. HCR001 and HCR062 now recognize retained clients and freshly configured factory helpers, HCR060/HCR081 follow branch-owned and wrapped response/stream transfers, HCR061 accepts fatal success guards before a read result is observed, HCR065 understands mutually exclusive request sends, and test-context detection covers test attributes, base types, namespaces, and test directories.",
